        <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/ipc/H01L_25-065>,
        <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/ipc/H10B_41-27>,
        <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/ipc/H10B_41-40>,
        <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/ipc/H10B_41-50>,
        <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/ipc/H10B_43-27>,
