        <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/patent/other_ZhenghaoShenetalTheeffectofoxygenannealingoncharacteristicsofGa2O3solarblindphotodetectorsonSiCsubstratebyioncuttingprocessJournalofAlloysandCompounds889202116174320210829> ;
